Subject: [PATCH 11/18] fix(stage): the wings hide what rides in from beyond
 the view, not what was in sight there

From a review of the series, by reading: macOS-only code.

The strips around the visible frame lie in front of every stand-in. A window
that hangs into the strip beside the Dock, pinned, floating or left alone, lost
that part to the wallpaper when the stage came into sight, and got it back when
the stage dropped. Such windows are drawn in front of the wings for as long as
there are wings, through the landing too.

`follow` no longer places again what keeps its place.
