Subject: [PATCH 15/18] fix(gesture): a window of another display that reaches
 over, and is moved there, ends the gesture

Found by the chaos lab's new rule, that nothing a held stage shows is moved
behind it (seed 300 of a hunt of 600). A window that belongs to the display
beside and reaches over has a stand-in here, which keeps its place. A command
for its own display moved it, and the stand-in went on showing it where it was.
A layout of a display whose windows have stand-ins on another display's held
stage returns the view there first.
